sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client /<br/>Guardrails Orchestrator
    participant BuiltIn as Built-in Detector<br/>(FastAPI)
    participant LLMJudge as LLM Judge Detector<br/>(FastAPI)
    participant MinIO as MinIO Server<br/>9000/TCP
    participant PVC as PVC<br/>guardrails-models-claim-guardian<br/>100Gi
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub

    Note over MinIO,HF: Model Provisioning (Init Phase)
    rect rgb(255, 245, 220)
        HF->>PVC: Download model artifacts<br/>(ibm-granite/granite-guardian-3.0-2b)<br/>via init container (llm_downloader)
        MinIO->>PVC: Mount and serve model files<br/>S3-compatible API
    end

    Note over Client,BuiltIn: Built-in Detector Flow (Content Analysis)
    rect rgb(220, 235, 255)
        Client->>BuiltIn: GET /registry<br/>No Auth
        BuiltIn-->>Client: Available detectors list

        Client->>BuiltIn: POST /api/v1/text/contents<br/>No Auth
        Note right of BuiltIn: RegexDetectorRegistry<br/>FileTypeDetectorRegistry<br/>CustomDetectorRegistry
        BuiltIn-->>Client: Detection results

        Client->>BuiltIn: GET /metrics<br/>No Auth
        BuiltIn-->>Client: Prometheus metrics
    end

    Note over Client,LLMJudge: LLM Judge Detector Flow (LLM-as-Judge)
    rect rgb(220, 255, 220)
        Client->>LLMJudge: POST /api/v1/text/contents<br/>No Auth
        LLMJudge->>MinIO: Fetch model artifacts<br/>S3 API / Port 9000<br/>Static credentials
        MinIO-->>LLMJudge: Model data
        Note right of LLMJudge: Evaluate against metrics:<br/>safety, toxicity,<br/>accuracy, helpfulness
        LLMJudge-->>Client: Evaluation results

        Client->>LLMJudge: POST /api/v1/text/generation<br/>No Auth
        LLMJudge->>MinIO: Fetch model artifacts<br/>S3 API / Port 9000
        MinIO-->>LLMJudge: Model data
        LLMJudge-->>Client: Generation analysis results

        Client->>LLMJudge: GET /api/v1/metrics<br/>No Auth
        LLMJudge-->>Client: Available metrics list
    end
